Fresh Pi session: PR FEEDBACK CLASSIFICATION.

Inputs:
- Normalized work item artifact: {{run.dir}}/work-tracker/item.json
- PR feedback: {{run.dir}}/pr/feedback/feedback.json
- Repository root: {{inputs.repo-root}}

Use only these provider-neutral fields from the normalized work item:
- identifier
- title
- description
- state.name
- priority
- assignees[].display_name or assignees[].id
- labels[].name or labels[].id
- url

Rules:
- Do not edit source code.
- Do not call Plane, Jira, GitHub, Slack, or other external APIs.
- Classify only actionable PR feedback.
- Do not use tracker configuration, credential references, raw provider responses, or the provider-specific remote scope.

Write:
- Status: {{run.dir}}/pr/feedback-status-{{run.feedback-cycle}}.json
- Report: {{run.dir}}/pr/feedback-report-{{run.feedback-cycle}}.md
- If actions are needed: {{run.dir}}/pr/feedback-issues-{{run.feedback-cycle}}.json

Status values:
{"status":"no_actions","summary":"short summary","issues_file":null}
{"status":"actions_needed","summary":"short summary","issues_file":"pr/feedback-issues-{{run.feedback-cycle}}.json"}
